> Interpretation and provenance

The retained checks and printed outcomes determine what this run supports. Weak or deferred quality checks are not evidence of full convergence. Native APIs provide pure differentiable model components, owning transitions and cloned-game search; every objective, optimizer, episode/self-play loop, controller search and training schedule stays editable above.

> Inspect the captured reconstruction and dreams

Left to right: the source real frame, its posterior-mean reconstruction, and the three original imagined frames. Gray levels show the decoder probabilities before the ASCII threshold at.5. Dreams use the most likely mixture component mean and repeated right actions, matching the source demonstration.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/world_models_frames.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){auto data=dm::nn::load_npz("build/world_models_source.npz");std::vector<dm::nn::Tensor>frames;for(const std::string key:{"frame","reconstruction","dream_0","dream_1","dream_2"}){auto it=std::find_if(data.begin(),data.end(),[&](const auto& item){return item.first==key;});if(it==data.end())throw std::runtime_error("source frame missing");frames.push_back(dm::nn::reshape(it->second,{1,12,24,1}));}dm::nn::save_image_grid(dm::nn::concat(frames,0),"build/world_models_frames.png",5,0,1,2,.5,10);}
